    "title": "PREVIEW: St. Anthony vs. Bishop Alemany, Football - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nina Fife ,\n10 hours ago The562’s football coverage for the 2026-27 school year is sponsored by Long Beach Poly alums Wendell “WoWo” Moe, Jr. & Tyson Ruffins. St. Anthony has had a lopsided 2026 season so far, suffering a slew of tough losses amounting to an 0-5 record so far. The Saints are back in action under Friday Night Lights, where they’ll host Bishop Alemany in search of their first win of the season as they head into Del Rey League play. Read full article",
